  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Manganese show pale purple colour in flame test.<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mo> </mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo> </mo></mrow></mover><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>↓</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>Black&nbsp;ppt.</mtext></mrow></munder></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Both <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> form precipitate with <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> in basic medium.<br /><br /><math> <mrow>  <mfenced>   <mtext>D</mtext>  </mfenced><msubsup>   <mtext>E</mtext>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>Cu</mtext></mrow>     <mrow>      <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow>    </msup>    <mo>&#x007C;</mo><mtext>Cu</mtext></mrow>   <mtext>o</mtext>  </msubsup>  <mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.34</mn><mtext>V</mtext><mo>,</mo><msubsup>   <mtext>E</mtext>   <mrow>    <msup>     <mrow>      <mtext>Mn</mtext></mrow>     <mrow>      <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow>    </msup>    <mo>&#x007C;</mo><mtext>Mn</mtex